        "headline": "國防部偵獲共機6架次共艦7艘 國軍飛彈與機艦嚴密監控",
        "summary": "國防部公布，自8月3日上午6時至4日上午6時止，共偵獲共機6架次侵擾西南及東部空域，另有共艦7艘及公務船6艘在台海周邊活動。國軍運用任務機艦及岸置飛彈系統嚴密監控應處。另據本站統計紀錄，前一次於8月2日記錄為共機3架次與共艦8艘。",
        "headline_en": "Taiwan Detects 6 PLA Aircraft and 7 Naval Vessels Near Airspace",
        "summary_en": "Taiwan's Ministry of National Defense reported that six Chinese military aircraft, seven naval vessels, and six official ships were detected operating around Taiwan between 6:00 a.m. on August 3 and 6:00 a.m. on August 4, 2026. The Chinese aircraft entered Taiwan's southwestern and eastern airspace. Taiwan's military deployed aircraft, naval vessels, and land-based missile systems to closely monitor and respond to the activities. According to AVWIRE's recorded statistics, the previous report on August 2 recorded three Chinese aircraft, eight naval vessels, and two official ships.",
